{% extends 'base.html.twig' %}

{% block title %}AC13.03 – Translate an algorithm into a given language{% endblock %}

{% block body %}
    <div class="container">

        <h1>AC13.03 – Translate an algorithm into a given language and environment</h1>

        <p>
            <strong>Objective :</strong>
            Transform algorithmic logic into functional code.
        </p>

        <hr>

        <h2>Reflective analysis</h2>

        <p>
            In this activity, I learned how to translate algorithmic logic into JavaScript code.
            The goal was to transform a sequence of logical steps into an executable program.
        </p>

        <p>
            I used React and JavaScript to implement simple features
            such as dynamic data display and user interaction handling.
        </p>

        <p>
            I also learned how to structure algorithmic reasoning before coding,
            in order to make the program clear and efficient.
        </p>

        <p>
            This activity helped me understand the link between an algorithm
            and its implementation in a real programming language.
        </p>

        <h2>Supporting documents</h2>
        <ul>
            <li>Algorithm written as step-by-step logic</li>
            <li>Translation into JavaScript / React</li>
            <li>Execution tests</li>
            <li>Results displayed in the browser</li>
        </ul>

        <h2>Illustrative image</h2>
        <div style="text-align:center;">
            <img src="{{ asset('images/ac1303.png') }}" alt="AC13.03" style="max-width:100%; height:auto;">
        </div>

        <!-- Navigation buttons -->
        <div style="display:flex; justify-content:space-between; margin-top:30px;">

            <a href="{{ path('app_En_ac1302') }}" class="btn btn-primary">
